    [6719]={name="Windborne Belt",quality=2,ilvl=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Highperch Venom'. In Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Highperch Venom",lore="As you may know, wyverns are often tamed by orcs for use as mounts. But what is less known is that the venom of a wyvern, in some circles, is more valuable than the beast itself."},
    [6720]={name="Spirit Hunter Headdress",quality=2,ilvl=37,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Frostmaw'. In Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Frostmaw",lore="it is now time for you to travel to far-off lands. You are ready. You now hunt Frostmaw, a yeti in the Alterac Mountains. He is elusive, his white coat blending into the snows of his mountain home."},
    [6723]={name="Medal of Courage",quality=3,ilvl=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Saving Yenniku' - pick it over the other choices. In Stranglethorn Vale.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Saving Yenniku",lore="I have reshaped the Mind's Eye into a Soul Gem. Its purpose is twofold: you must use it to stun Yenniku, and once stunned place it upon his head to entrap his soul."},
    [6744]={name="Gloves of Kapelan",quality=2,ilvl=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Alliance Relations' - pick it over the other choices. In Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Alliance Relations",lore="The fight goes well. Perhaps the Warchief will allow us to return to our homes before the seasons change if we continue to make such great strides in our battle against the demons and their underlings."},
    [6750]={name="Snake Hoop",quality=2,ilvl=31,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Willix the Importer' - pick it over the other choices. In Razorfen Kraul.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Willix the Importer",lore="At last, help has arrived! You have no clue how long I've been held prisoner here. I can't remember the last time I saw the outside of this place."},
    [6774]={name="Uthek's Finger",quality=2,ilvl=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha' - pick it over the other choices. In Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="you helped us against the Magram. Now, help us beat the Maraudine! Kill the head of their clan, Khan Hratha! To face him, blow the Maraudine War Horn."},
    [6784]={name="Braced Handguards",quality=2,ilvl=36,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bounty' - pick it over the other choices. In Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Centaur Bounty",lore="Now that you scared the centaur clans, it's time to bleed them. When traveling Desolace, hunt centaur. I don't care which clan you hunt. Just gather ears."},
    [6788]={name="Magram Hunter's Belt",quality=2,ilvl=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha' - pick it over the other choices. In Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="The Gelkis Khan is dead, and now the Maraudine will fall! Kill the Maraudine Khan, Hratha! To face him, blow the horn on the high bluff in the Valley of Spears."},
    [6803]={name="Prophetic Cane",quality=3,ilvl=44,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Into The Scarlet Monastery' - pick it over the other choices. In Scarlet Monastery.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="Into The Scarlet Monastery",lore="Whilst the Dark Lady tends to the pressing issue of the Lich King's advance to the north, I am seeing to it that matters closer to home are being taken care of accordingly."},
